      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. for the part about the 'regressive' viewpoints, can you give me some specific examples of arguments or mindsets that we could label that way in the lesson? i want to make sure the kids can identify those patterns when they see them in history.",
      "source": "evaluator"
